Tests identified in upstream.json and the current-fiber implementation in
../bippy/src/react-internals/current-fiber.ts contain adaptations from React.
The DevTools fixture's separate revision is recorded in the same upstream.json.
Test runner, TypeScript syntax, component names, and source-location normalization
are adapted for Bippy. Development-only ports do not cover production branches.

